      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><blockquote><p>Is there a version based on the STM32G4 available?</p></blockquote><p>According to the <strong><a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/evaluation-tools/steval-isa172v3.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Product Page</a></strong>, it <strong>is </strong>based on an STM32G4:</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/c1975698-461d-4ef6-9809-d3faff2aac45.png\"/></figure><p> </p><blockquote><p>Is the firmware package available for download?</p></blockquote><p>As always, all the available resources, downloads, etc are on the <strong><a href=\"https://www.st.com/en/evaluation-tools/steval-isa172v3.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Product Page</a></strong> - firmware would be on the ‘Tools &amp; Software’ tab.</p><p>When it’s not on the Product Page, that means you have to request it directly from ST - probably under NDA.</p><p>Find your local sales office here: <a href=\"https://www.st.com/content/st_com/en/contact-us.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.st.com/content/st_com/en/contact-us.html</a></p><p>Or raise a support case here: <a href=\"https://ols.st.com/s/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">https://ols.st.com/s/</a></p></div>"
